   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Toy Hug\n\nYour object, then the two plush toys turn to each other, lean together and hug.\n\nFreeField preset `toy-hug-studio`. Runs on a 24 GB GPU (studio profile: Wan 2.2 I2V-A14B). Open weights only.\n\n## Fill in\n- A clear photo of the object (a toy, a product, a mascot): the node **Your photo (preset input)**\n\n## Stages, left to right\n- 1\\. Your photo\n- 2\\. Animate (Wan 2.2 I2V-A14B, studio profile)\n- Save\n\n## Models\n- `umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors`\n- `wan_2.1_vae.safetensors`\n- `wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors`\n- `wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_high_noise.safetensors`\n- `wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors`\n- `wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_low_noise.safetensors`\n\n## What happens\nThis graph makes the finished video.\n\n## Run it\n1. Pick your file in the input node above and press Run.\n\nOr run the whole effect in FreeField: `python -m freefield run toy-hug-studio --photo me.jpg`\n\nLicense: umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors apache-2.0; wan_2.1_vae.safetensors apache-2.0; wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors apache-2.0; wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_high_noise.safetensors apache-2.0; wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors apache-2.0; wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_low_noise.safetensors apache-2.0\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# Toy Hug\n\nYour object, then the two plush toys turn to each other, lean together and hug.\n\nFreeField preset `toy-hug-studio`. Runs on a 24 GB GPU (studio profile: Wan 2.2 I2V-A14B). Open weights only.\n\n## Fill in\n- A clear photo of the object (a toy, a product, a mascot): the node **Your photo (preset input)**\n\n## Stages, left to right\n- 1\\. Your photo\n- 2\\. Animate (Wan 2.2 I2V-A14B, studio profile)\n- Save\n\n## Models\n- `umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors`\n- `wan_2.1_vae.safetensors`\n- `wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors`\n- `wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_high_noise.safetensors`\n- `wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors`\n- `wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_low_noise.safetensors`\n\n## What happens\nThis graph makes the finished video.\n\n## Run it\n1. Pick your file in the input node above and press Run.\n\nOr run the whole effect in FreeField: `python -m freefield run toy-hug-studio --photo me.jpg`\n\nLicense: umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors apache-2.0; wan_2.1_vae.safetensors apache-2.0; wan2.2_i2v_high_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors apache-2.0; wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_high_noise.safetensors apache-2.0; wan2.2_i2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors apache-2.0; wan2.2_i2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1_low_noise.safetensors apache-2.0\n"
   },
